<title>FRANCE: GAN, UIC shares suspended - SBF.</title>
<headline>GAN, UIC shares suspended - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of the French state-controlled insurer Groupe des Assurances Nationales (GAN) and its troubled property unit UIC were suspended on the Paris bourse on Thursday pending a statement, a spokesman for the SBF stock markets association said.</p>
<p>The GAN board is meeting later on Thursday and is expected to reveal how much it will need to shore up its accounts. It has been in talks with the finance ministry about a state bailout package. A portion of GAN's capital is quoted on the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
